{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GvnzqKbdjCmr1LZQ5cpUip","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_2/projects/ratekv/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 14\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP 验证方案: Llama 3.1-8B 上验证 eviction-quantization crossover 存在性 + MCKP\\\\n    分配有效性'\\\\n  rationale: '核心假设是 per-KV-head 异质性使得 joint eviction+quantization allocation 优于 uniform\\\\n    quantization。最小验证: 单模型 distortion profiling + crossover 可视化 + MCKP vs uniform\\\\n    4-bit 对比。Pass 标准: ≥15% heads prefer eviction + perplexity improvement。选 Llama\\\\n    3.1-8B 因为 DuoAttention 已有该模型的 streaming/retrieval head 分类数据可做 post-hoc validation。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP gate v2: 加 quant-only MCKP baseline + 消除死区 + 最小效应量 ≥0.5 PPL'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 初审指出三个漏洞: (1) uniform 4-bit 太弱，任何 per-head 方法都能赢，核心 claim 是\\\\n    joint > quant-only，必须加 quant-only MCKP baseline; (2) 5%-15% crossover 比例死区导致判定模糊，合并为单一\\\\n    ≥10% 阈值; (3) PPL 改善无最小效应量可能产生假阳性，设 ≥0.5 PPL 门槛。quant-only baseline 零额外工程量（同一 solver\\\\n    限制 action set）。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 18:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 模型从 Llama 3.1-8B 切换到 Qwen2.5-7B，DuoAttention validation 延后\\\\n  rationale: Llama 3.1-8B 是 HF gated model，用户尚未提供 HF token，GPU 空闲不能等。Qwen2.5-7B 非\\\\n    gated、GQA 架构、7B 参数量相近，满足 MVP 验证 per-KV-head crossover 假设的需求。代价：DuoAttention post-hoc\\\\n    validation（D001 rationale 中的 convergent evidence story）暂时无法做——DuoAttention 论文只分析了\\\\n    Llama 系列。替代方案：(1) 用户后续提供 HF token 后加 Llama 作为第二模型；(2) 在 Qwen 上自行运行 DuoAttention\\\\n    分类作为替代验证。MVP 核心假设（crossover 存在性 + MCKP 优于 uniform）不依赖 DuoAttention 叙事。注意：Qwen2.5-7B\\\\n    的 KV head 数（4×28=112）少于 Llama（8×32=256），GQA ratio 更高（7:1 vs 4:1），crossover 比例可能偏低。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 21:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: 1.5B sanity 暴露 attention MSE 与 PPL 脱钩；7B 继续跑但需准备 metric 修正方案\\\\n  rationale: Qwen2.5-1.5B sanity 结果显示：(1) crossover 只在 8x 极端压缩出现（89.3% heads），此时 PPL\\\\n    已崩溃（14000+）；(2) 在实用的 4x 压缩下 full MCKP 反而比 quant-only 差 2.77 PPL，甚至比 uniform 4-bit\\\\n    差 3.41 PPL；(3) 根因是 attention output MSE 系统性低估 eviction 的 downstream 损伤——eviction\\\\n    是 structured error（完整丢弃 token），量化是 unstructured error（均匀噪声），MSE 无法区分两者的级联影响。形式上\\\\n    MVP gate PASS 但实质不成立（在 catastrophic regime 的 false positive）。7B 实验已提交继续跑，确认 pattern\\\\n    是否 model-agnostic。同时需准备 metric 修正：(a) layer-output MSE 替代 attention-output MSE；(b)\\\\n    eviction distortion penalty；(c) gate criteria 收紧排除 PPL>2x baseline 的 regime。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sanity_004\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: crossover exists but metric-PPL decoupled\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 22:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 实质 FAIL：attention MSE 被 falsify，pivot 到 chunk-level PPL distortion\\\\n    metric\\\\n  rationale: 7B 结果灾难性确认 metric-PPL 脱钩：budget=0.25 下 MSE 最优方案(Full MCKP) PPL=1084 vs\\\\n    MSE 最差方案(uniform 4-bit) PPL=15.45，反差 70×。更关键的是 quant-only MCKP (5574) vs uniform\\\\n    4-bit (15.45) 证明 MSE 对 quantization bit 分配同样失效——问题不仅限于 eviction。问题随模型规模指数级恶化（1.5B\\\\n    比 1.2×, 7B 比 70×）。被 falsify 的是 attention output MSE 作为 distortion proxy，不是 per-head\\\\n    MCKP framework 或 crossover 假设。立即 pivot：P0 并行跑 chunk-level PPL distortion profiling\\\\n    + 2-bit quant 隔离测试，验证 PPL-aligned metric 能否让 solver 做出正确分配。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_004\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: MSE-PPL 70x decoupling at 7B; MCKP allocation harmful under MSE\\\\n  - exp_id: sanity_004\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: MSE-PPL 1.2x decoupling at 1.5B\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 23:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: PPL-guided MCKP 仍然失败：根因是 eviction 的 compounding effect 违反 per-head 独立性假设；转向\\\\n    targeted hybrid 策略\\\\n  rationale: PPL-based distortion profiling 结果：Full MCKP 28.07 vs Quant-only 15.45\\\\n    vs Uniform 15.45。换 metric 没解决问题——per-head 独立 profiling 中单 head eviction delta\\\\n    仅 ~0.13，但 47 heads 同时 eviction 产生 compounding effect (+18.26 PPL)。eviction 是 structured\\\\n    error，多头同时丢弃同一批 token，损伤不可加。Quantization 独立性成立（quant-only MCKP = uniform 15.45）。另外\\\\n    PPL profiling 分辨率不足（100/112 heads 显示相同 delta），需更多 eval tokens。两个可行方向：(A) targeted\\\\n    hybrid——仅 Layer 0 cliff heads 用 eviction（quantization 损伤极大），其余全 quantization +\\\\n    非均匀 bit 分配；(B) group-level eviction profiling (O(n²))。优先试 A，低成本高信息量。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: p0_1_ppl_fast\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: PPL-guided MCKP still 1.8x worse than uniform; eviction compounding effect\\\\n  - exp_id: p0_2_cliff_7B\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: Layer 0 is only cliff layer; 3/112 heads sensitive to 2-bit\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 23:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Pivot: 放弃 eviction arm，转向 PPL-guided per-head bit-width allocation (quant-only\\\\n    MCKP with {2,4,8,16}-bit)'\\\\n  rationale: Joint eviction+quantization 核心假设已被 falsify——eviction 的 compounding effect\\\\n    使 per-head 独立 profiling 原理上无法 work。但 Reviewer 指出关键盲区：之前 quant-only MCKP = uniform\\\\n    是 fast mode artifact（只有一个 4-bit 选项，solver 数学上只能 uniform），不是真实证据。Cliff data 证明\\\\n    per-head quantization sensitivity 高度不均匀（L0H0 2-bit +297% vs 大多数 head <1%）。关键实验：PPL-guided\\\\n    quant-only MCKP，action space {2,4,8,16}-bit，budget 4x。如果 MCKP PPL < uniform 4-bit\\\\n    ≥0.5 → 论文 pivot 为 rate-distortion optimal per-head bit-width allocation；如果 ≈ uniform\\\\n    → archive。~4h GPU 即可做 go/no-go 决策。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 23:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'exp_b MIXED: 假设验证(手动24%↑)但solver失败; 采用Path B去掉2-bit修复solver'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查 exp_b full bit-width MCKP 结果：(1) 自动 solver 因 profiler 分辨率不足(84%\\\\n    heads delta=0.0000@2-bit)和 additive model 无法捕获 compounding effect，PPL 崩溃至 36.92\\\\n    且 under-budget 28%；(2) 手动 budget-matched 分配(L0@8bit, 8@2bit, rest@4bit) PPL=11.69\\\\n    vs uniform 15.45，改善 3.76 (24%)，远超 0.5 阈值——假设\\\\\\\"非均匀分配优于均匀\\\\\\\"成立；(3) 2-bit compounding\\\\n    effect 在 8-24 heads 间出现拐点，per-head 独立 profiling 无法发现此阈值。决定采用 Path B：去掉 2-bit 选项，用\\\\n    4/8/16-bit 三选项 MCKP，避免 compounding effect 同时仍能捕获 Layer 0 sensitivity 差异。实现后重跑\\\\n    solver 获取 clean MVP pass。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_b_hires_quant\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: mixed — manual pass, auto solver fail\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 23:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: '撤回 D008 Path B; 改为 constrained MCKP: 保留 2-bit 但加 count(2-bit)≤8 约束'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 D008 的 Path B（去掉 2-bit）在 budget=0.25 下数学上退化为 uniform 4-bit——最廉价选项就是\\\\n    4-bit(ratio=0.25)，没有更便宜的选项来节省 budget 资助升级。手动实验(PPL 11.69)之所以能 work，正是靠 8 heads@2-bit\\\\n    节省的 budget(8×(0.25-0.125)=1.0)来资助 4 heads@8-bit 升级(4×(0.50-0.25)=1.0)。正确修复：保留\\\\n    {2,4,8,16}-bit action space，增加 cardinality constraint count(2-bit)≤8。K=8 基于手动实验安全区间（8@2-bit\\\\n    → PPL 11.69 PASS，24@2-bit → PPL 17.74 FAIL）。这是 MCKP 文献中的标准 cardinality constraint，保留理论框架的同时避免\\\\n    compounding effect。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_b_hires_quant\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: manual pass informs constraint K=8\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP PASS: constrained MCKP solver PPL=11.23 vs uniform 15.45 (27%↑), 进入research阶段'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 确认 exp_c_constrained_mckp 通过 MVP gate：(1) PPL=11.23 vs uniform\\\\n    4-bit 15.45，改善 4.21 (27%)，远超 0.5 阈值；(2) budget 精确匹配 0.2500；(3) solver 自动输出优于手动\\\\n    oracle (11.23 vs 11.69, +0.46)；(4) 数据一致性已核实（日志/results.json/registry notes 完全一致）。solver\\\\n    使用 max_2bit=8 + L0 excluded from 2-bit 约束，分配 4×8-bit + 8×2-bit + 100×4-bit。Layer\\\\n    0 全部 8-bit 是 solver 基于 profiling delta 自主选择。Research 阶段需跟进：(a) 去掉 L0 排除约束测试 solver\\\\n    是否自动回避 L0 2-bit；(b) 多模型验证（不同 GQA ratio）；(c) 高分辨率 profiling；(d) cardinality constraint\\\\n    的理论阐释。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_c_constrained_mckp\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: PASS — PPL 11.23 vs uniform 15.45 (27%)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: Solver auto-discovers L0 sensitivity — plan_001 validated, manual L0 exclusion\\\\n    constraint proven redundant\\\\n  rationale: exp_d (no L0 exclusion) 产生与 exp_c (L0 excluded) 完全一致的分配结果 (PPL=11.23,\\\\n    budget=0.2500, 同一 bit 分布)。Solver 仅凭 profiling distortion 信号自动将 L0 保持 8-bit。方法论更干净：只需\\\\n    cardinality constraint max_2bit≤K，无需手动 layer 排除。同时 exp_c_no2bit 证实 2-bit 是 heterogeneity\\\\n    的必要条件（去掉后退化为 uniform 4-bit）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_d_no_l0_exclusion\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: success - identical allocation without manual L0 exclusion\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_c_constrained_mckp\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: success - reference with manual L0 exclusion\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_c_no2bit\\\\n    role: supporting_negative\\\\n    result: negative - confirms 2-bit necessity for heterogeneity\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: Corrected RateQuant characterization in paper_framing.md; upgraded plan_008\\\\n    to P0, plan_012 to P1; added plan_014 (K/V separation) at P1\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 paper_framing.md 对 RateQuant 的描述有误——RateQuant 有 discrete\\\\n    greedy (Algorithm 1, Prop. 6) 而非仅 continuous waterfilling。Mischaracterize 竞争工作是审稿大忌。同时：(1)\\\\n    plan_008 升 P0 因为 differentiation claim 需要实验证据证明 RateQuant greedy 在 {2,4,8,16}\\\\n    上不 optimal；(2) plan_012 升 P1 因为 RateQuant 有 downstream eval 我们不能缺；(3) 新增 plan_014\\\\n    K/V separation 因为 RateQuant 支持 asymmetric K/V，MCKP 天然支持但需要实验验证。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_008\\\\n    role: upgraded_to_P0\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_012\\\\n    role: upgraded_to_P1\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_014\\\\n    role: new_P1\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'plan_008 SUCCESS: RateQuant greedy catastrophically fails on {2,4,8,16}\\\\n    (PPL 32.45 vs MCKP 11.23), confirming polymatroid structure breaks on non-consecutive\\\\n    bit-widths'\\\\n  rationale: RateQuant greedy 将 68/112 heads 降至 2-bit 换取 10 个 16-bit head，compounding\\\\n    导致 PPL 崩溃到 32.45。Constrained MCKP 限制 max_2bit=8 避免了 compounding，PPL=11.23。Gap=21.22\\\\n    证明：(1) 非连续步长破坏 polymatroid structure，greedy 不再 optimal；(2) cardinality constraint\\\\n    是 greedy 框架无法自动发现的；(3) MCKP 在 hardware-aligned action space 上有决定性优势。同时 k=10/12\\\\n    补充数据确认 k=8 是精确极值点。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ratequant_greedy_comparison\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: success - greedy PPL 32.45 vs MCKP 11.23\\\\n  - exp_id: compounding_sweep_k10_12\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: success - k=8 confirmed as precise optimum\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 10122, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Erf66SjA39eg1wxkhWKcqD","session_id":"f18b23f9-5ca3-4537-a235-cc404c8c8259","uuid":"db36b6ea-1b44-4c31-9a27-0b9c1985464d","timestamp":"2026-05-14T01:05:44.606Z"}
